version: "0.42.0-beta"
date-released: "2026-10-01"
abstract: >-
  AgentEval is a .NET toolkit for evaluating AI agents, built for Microsoft Agent
  Framework (MAF) and Microsoft.Extensions.AI. It covers tool-usage validation, RAG
  quality metrics, stochastic evaluation, model comparison and memory benchmarks,
  with fluent assertion APIs, and targets .NET 8, 9 and 10. Its red-team probes and
  evaluators can also run as fail-closed runtime gates in an agent's request path
  (Gatekeeper).
